> **Purpose**: Track train/test paths to avoid missing data during processing.

| Split | Images Path | Annotations Path | Count | Status |
|-------|-------------|------------------|-------|--------|
| **Train** | `images/funsd_plus_train_*.jpg` | `train/data-00000-of-00001.arrow` | 1,026 | ✅ |
