##### Sub-Datasets Included

| Sub-Dataset | Description | Contents |
|-------------|-------------|----------|
| **DIBCO_2009_2018/** | Document Image Binarization Competition | Multi-year competition images |
| **DIBCO_2009_2018.zip** | Compressed archive | Original download |
