#### Dataset Statistics

| Metric | Value |
|--------|-------|
| **Total Images** | 5,000 enhanced + 500 base = 5,500 |
| **Base Images** | 500 real-world distorted images |
| **Enhancement Methods** | Multiple document enhancement techniques |
