| **Total PDF Pages** | 8,500+ |
| **Selected Documents** | 350 unstructured PDFs |
| **Q&A Pairs** | 8,498 |
| **Domains** | 7 (Textbook, Law, Finance, Newspaper, Manual, Academic, Administration) |
| **OCR Components** | 5 (plain text, table, formula, chart, reading order) |
